 rel="nofollow" >
 <span itemprop="name">
 Stat Milestones
 </span>
 </a>
 <div itemprop="description">
 <h2>Do note that most of these don&#39;t work.</h2>
<h3>Strength Milestones</h3>
<p><strong>25 STR:</strong> Increases the base damage of Strike to 6.5.</p>
<p><strong>60 STR:</strong> Take 10% less damage when blocking.</p>
<p><strong>110 STR:</strong> Reduce the cooldown of Physical Element attacks by 1.</p>
<p>‌</p>
<h3>Arcane Milestones</h3>
<p><strong>25 ARC:</strong> Be able to use an extra potion.</p>
<p><strong>60 ARC:</strong> 15% chance to gain an extra energy at the start of the turn.</p>
<p><strong>110 ARC:</strong> Reduce the cooldown of Magic Element attacks by 1.</p>
<p>‌</p>
<h3>Speed Milestones</h3>
<p><strong>25 SPD:</strong> Enemies are less likely to dodge your attacks.</p>
<p><strong>60 SPD:</strong> Increases the size of the dodge bar.</p>
<p><strong>110 SPD:</strong> Gain a 5% chance to autododge attacks.</p>
<p>‌</p>
<h3>Endurance Milestones</h3>
<p><strong>25 END:</strong> Take 20% less damage from status effects.</p>
<p><strong>60 END:</strong> Gain 35% Incoming healing.</p>
<p><strong>110 END:</strong> Increase passive regen by 2.</p>
<p>‌</p>
<h3>Luck Milestones</h3>
<p><strong>25 LCK:</strong> Increases Crit Damage by 10%.</p>
<p><strong>60 LCK:</strong> Gain 35% Outgoing healing.</p>
<p><strong>110 LCK:</strong> Gain gold after battles.</p>
 </div>
