 <li itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/ListItem">
 <a itemprop="url" href="/c/5yeDVTSm/359-alignment"
 rel="nofollow" >
 <span itemprop="name">
 Alignment
 </span>
 </a>
 <div itemprop="description">
 <p>Alignment also known as Reputation, required to get Super Classes</p>
<p><strong>Orderly</strong> Classes require <strong>Orderly</strong> alignment<br><strong>Neutral</strong> Classes require <strong>Any</strong> alignment<br><strong>Chaotic</strong> Classes require <strong>Chaotic</strong> alignment</p>
<hr>
<p>Alignment can be obtained from Alignment Potions and Alignment Quests<br>Alignment Potions are:<br><a href="https://trello.com/c/IUgpxYF5/177-heartsoothing-remedy" title="smartCard-inline">https://trello.com/c/IUgpxYF5/177-heartsoothing-remedy</a> (Orderly Alignment)<br><a href="https://trello.com/c/KsEwOJAc/178-heartbreaking-elixir" title="smartCard-inline">https://trello.com/c/KsEwOJAc/178-heartbreaking-elixir</a> (Chaotic Alignment)</p>
<hr>
<p>Different Classes required different amount of alignment</p>
<hr>
<p>It is recommended to drink 8-9 potions <strong>BEFORE</strong> doing 2 quests, for maximum efficiency to get your class</p>
 </div>
 <h4>Labels</h4>
