 <li itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/ListItem">
 <a itemprop="url" href="/c/U1nOerWn/357-day-night-cycle"
 rel="nofollow" >
 <span itemprop="name">
 Day/Night cycle
 </span>
 </a>
 <div itemprop="description">
 <p>The game swaps between days and night every 13 minutes naturally and in most cases every server shares the day and night cycle until it was broken by a <a href="https://trello.com/c/9NPNLPOe/82-skyward-totem" title="‌">Totem</a>.</p>
<hr>
<p>Players get premature alerts for night time &amp; day time</p>
<hr>
<p>Night cycle have special Enemies and a chance to start an <a href="https://trello.com/c/ExnPimRW" title="‌">Astral Night</a><br>Day cycle have a chance to start a <a href="https://trello.com/c/sCCWRnqq/107-corrupted-skies" title="‌">Corrupted Skies</a></p>
<p>If someone used a <a href="https://trello.com/c/9NPNLPOe/82-skyward-totem" title="‌">Totem</a> during Night and it is not <a href="https://trello.com/c/ExnPimRW" title="‌">Astral Night</a>, It will turn Day time and give <a href="https://trello.com/c/sCCWRnqq/107-corrupted-skies" title="‌">Corrupted Skies</a>, otherwise if <a href="https://trello.com/c/ExnPimRW" title="‌">Astral Night</a> is active, <a href="https://trello.com/c/9NPNLPOe/82-skyward-totem" title="‌">Totem</a> will just not work.</p>
 </div>
