 <div itemprop="description">
 <p>Titles are permanent text displayed next to your in-game name, usually obtained by winning events (such as fanart events) or by being the first to achieve something (for example, being the first to obtain the Astra Mark, etc.).</p>
<h1>[Titles]</h1>
<p>Fool - first to wipe 100 times<br>Soul Wanderer - first to reroll race 50 times<br>Prodigy - first super class<br>Hero - first enchant<br>Loyal - first max guilds<br>Hands of midas - first 100k from selling items<br>Archmage - first lost scroll<br>Riftwalker - first petent<br>Venian prince - first venia<br>Accursed one - first amorus<br>Slime prince - first lentum<br>Slayer of beasts - first boss (not slime king)<br>Tinkerer - first to wear full b2 (doesn’t exist anymore)<br>Starborn - first astra</p>
<hr>
<p>N/A - first tempurus (unobtainable)</p>
 </div>
