 <div itemprop="description">
 <p>The Neutral Superclass of the Warrior, a duelist who moves like a whisper through the battlefield, weaving steel and motion into a seamless dance of precision. Each strike flows into the next, building tempo and momentum, rewarding those who can keep their rhythm unbroken. Their mastery lies in chaining fluid combos, slipping between attacks, and striking at just the right moment, as if the fight itself were choreographed to their will.</p>
<p>The trainers name is Leoran, they can be found at the entrance of Icerift Approach on the left side.</p>
<p>Total Cost: <strong>3750g</strong> | <strong>750g</strong> per skill</p>
<p>Total skills: <strong>5</strong> | <strong>(3 Actives, 2 Passives)</strong></p>
