</ul>
<p>This is the 2nd Skill you learn, requiring you to be at least Level 15 to learn</p>
</blockquote>
<p>‌</p>
<p>[Parry Training] - <em>“Gives you the ability to ‘Parry’ attacks occasionally when you block.”</em></p>
<blockquote>
<ul>
<li>This can trigger multiple times on a single attack and will work whilst guarding. This only affects melee attacks and cannot crit or trigger any special effects. The parry damage scales on strength.</li>
</ul>
<p>This is the 4th Skill you learn, requiring you to be at least Level 21 to learn<br>notes:</p>
<ul>
<li>(Parry is now 100% guaranteed regardless of Mastery)</li>
<li>Parrying an attack reduces its damage by an additional 70%</li>
</ul>
