<p>[Simple Domain] - <em>“Take a stance for a turn, if attacked during this then retaliate with incredible power”</em><br>2 NRG | 6T CD | Physical | X*1.6 | STR/60<br>Self-Target | Unblockable and Undodgeable</p>
