 <div itemprop="description">
 <p>The Chaotic Superclass of the Warrior, a warrior fueled by rage, constantly taking damage to retaliate with strikes even more powerful than the last. Empowered by their Bloodlust and ability to use their own rage to convert their health into damage, fighting until their last breath and then getting back up to continue that fight out of pure rage</p>
