<p>[Flourish] - <em>“Charge up energy into your bow, and after a turn fire off a spread of arrows.”</em><br>2 NRG | 6T CD | Nature | 11 DMG | ARC/60 + SPD/80<br>Enemy-Wide | Ranged | Sure Hit | ? circles at base</p>
