</ul>
<p>This is the 2nd Skill you learn, requiring you to be at least Level 17 to learn</p>
</blockquote>
<p>‌</p>
<p>[Perennial Canopy] - <em>“Raise your bow into the air and create a downpour of arrows for a duration.”</em><br>2 NRG | 7T CD | Nature | 4 DMG | ARC/70 + SPD/100<br>Enemy-Wide | Ranged | Sure Hit | ? circles at base</p>
