<p>This is the 3rd Skill you learn, requiring you to be at least Level 19 to learn</p>
</blockquote>
<p>‌</p>
<p>[Stinger] - <em>“Thrust your dagger into the enemy, then backflip and fire three coated arrows.”</em><br>2 NRG | 4T CD | Poison | <strong>Damage:</strong> 5Dmg + 10Dmg (2Hits) | ARC/70 + SPD/100<br>Single-target + Adjacent | Melee + Ranged | Dodgeable | ? circles at base</p>
<blockquote>
<ul>
