<li>Only the initial heal scales with the move’s scaling. The regen is static.</li>
<li>The initial heal scales with outgoing at half your outgoing value.</li>
<li>The regen scales with outgoing at the full outgoing value.</li>
</ul>
<p>This is the 5th Skill you learn, requiring you to be at least Level 23 to learn</p>
