 rel="nofollow" >
 <span itemprop="name">
 Blades of the World
 </span>
 </a>
 <div itemprop="description">
 <p>Blades of the World includes gold boosting, free Mulligan (basically one shot protection) and a free active aswell as 2 Accessories</p>
<p><strong>How to progress:</strong> You get 1 progression by giving gold and 3 progression by doing quests in the blade board. (you can only do quests from the blades board after you get initiate blade which means you need to buy the first 3 levels to do so)</p>
<hr>
<h2><strong>Rank Total Gold / Quest + Skills and Obtainables</strong></h2>
<p>Rank 1 | 250G <em>(PASSIVE)</em> <strong>Mercenary</strong> - Gain more from guild requests by 50% and 3x the amount of the potion rewards.</p>
