 <li itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/ListItem">
 <a itemprop="url" href="/c/wJJIU1Wo/245-church-of-raphion"
 rel="nofollow" >
 <span itemprop="name">
 Church of Raphion
 </span>
 </a>
 <div itemprop="description">
 <h1>#</h1>
<p><strong>Joining in Church of Raphion:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Speak with Sky Man, give him Mushroom Cap, Sand Core and Rot Core, then speak with him again and teleport</li>
<li>Find Mael and speak with him to join in covenant</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>NOTES:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>you can’t join the CoR if you are currently in CoT (just switch to WoL or BoTW first then change to CoR).</li>
</ul>
<hr>
<p>Church of Raphion provides a weak cleansing heal and a total support actives with 2 passives that&#39;s can be used for supporting even if you are not a support class. Aswell as giving you the ability to teleport to Seraphon.</p>
<p><strong>How to progress:</strong> You get 2 progression everytime you heal an ally (this counts for Bless, Spreading Grace passive, and saint actives) You also get progression for healing yourself. (regen doesn’t count, but ranger’s enrichment does). The amount of healing needed per rank is the same as its level. (+1 interval every rank up, ex. rank 1 = 1, rank 2 = 2, rank 3 = 3 and so on, so forth)</p>
<hr>
<h2><strong>Rank Total Heal and Obtainables</strong></h2>
<p>Rank 0 | On join <em>(ACTIVE)</em> <strong>Bless</strong> - <strong>Cost</strong>: 1 | <strong>Cooldown</strong>: 5 | <strong>Type</strong>: Holy | <strong>Scaling</strong>: Unknown | <strong>Effect</strong>: Clears basic debuffs (burn, vulnerable, ?) on a target, and heals them for 2% per type of debuff cleansed</p>
<p><img src="https://trello.com/1/cards/67c14edde8647d34aa728d18/attachments/697895d463a1d7c9ea928246/download/%D0%91%D0%B5%D0%B7%2B%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%B7%D0%B2%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%8F31_20260127153847.png" alt="%D0%91%D0%B5%D0%B7%2B%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%B7%D0%B2%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%8F31\_20260127153847.png"></p>
<p>Rank 5 | 15 Total Heals <em>(PASSIVE)</em> <strong>Supporting Light</strong> - After buffing a target, recover some hp and gain a boost to damage reduction for 2 turns.</p>
<p>Rank 10 <em>(+2 SP)</em> | 30 Total Heals <em>(ACTIVE)</em> <strong>Holy Light</strong> - <strong>Cost</strong>: 2 | <strong>Cooldown</strong>: 5 | <strong>Type</strong>: Holy | <strong>Scaling</strong>: N/A | <strong>Effect:</strong> 5% DR buff and a .5% regen for 4 turns upon usage. Grants all allies 15% of the caster’s health as ShieldHP</p>
<p><img src="https://trello.com/1/cards/67c14edde8647d34aa728d18/attachments/697895d652124205e620b79b/download/%D0%91%D0%B5%D0%B7%2B%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%B7%D0%B2%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%8F31_20260127153903.png" alt="%D0%91%D0%B5%D0%B7%2B%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%B7%D0%B2%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%8F31\_20260127153903.png"></p>
<p>Rank 15 | 65 Total Heals <em>(PASSIVE)</em> <strong>Spreading Grace</strong> - Meditating gives one other person in the party +1 energy as well, and getting hit during your meditation creates a burst of healing for your team that recovers (?) hp.</p>
<p>Rank 20 <em>(+3 SP)</em> | 105 Total Heals <em>(PASSIVE)</em> <strong>N/A</strong> - Grants the ability to teleport/host and fight Seraphon</p>
<hr>
<p>&quot;Total Heals&quot; needed might still be <strong>inaccurate</strong><br>-<br>Credits: gostiar (for giving me idea to the calculation)</p>
