 <li itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/ListItem">
 <a itemprop="url" href="/c/PqAx6waz/246-cult-of-thanasius"
 rel="nofollow" >
 <span itemprop="name">
 Cult of Thanasius
 </span>
 </a>
 <div itemprop="description">
 <p>Joining in Cult of Thanasius</p>
<ul>
<li>Come to Deeproot Depths and find the mirror, by choosing the options “Death” and “I wish to become its harbringer” you will be granted the “Prayer” active</li>
<li>use the &quot;Prayer&quot; to start a fight with the Sheea Elementalist</li>
<li>Fight with Sheea elementalist, kill them and then speak with mirror again to teleport</li>
<li>Find Mephisto and speak with him to join in covenant</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>NOTES:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>you can’t join the CoT if you are currently in CoR (just switch to WoL or BoTW first then change to CoT).</li>
</ul>
<hr>
<p>Cult of Thanasius provides an ability to use dark type skills aswell as extra energy on kill and a passive that makes you weak to light but resist to dark.</p>
<p><strong>How to progress:</strong> You get 1 progression for everytime you kill an enemy, more progression if enemy was killed by soul absorption.</p>
<hr>
<h2><strong>Rank Total Absorbs and Obtainables</strong></h2>
<p>Rank 0 | On join <em>(ACTIVE)</em> <strong>Soul Absorb</strong> - <strong>Cost</strong>: 1 | <strong>Cooldown</strong>: 4 | <strong>Type</strong>: Dark | <strong>Damage</strong>: 2 | <strong>Scaling</strong>: N/A | <strong>Effect</strong>: Deal 2 damage, but instantly kill enemy if they have 5% (2.5% of max hp for bosses) or less of max hp and the attack hits them (will not kill if the enemy blocks or dodges it, being immune to dark damage also prevents the kill).</p>
<p><img src="https://trello.com/1/cards/67c14ee5f471dea59d5ec653/attachments/697896ca8e294b9d75e09576/download/%D0%91%D0%B5%D0%B7%2B%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%B7%D0%B2%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%8F31_20260127154224.png" alt="%D0%91%D0%B5%D0%B7%2B%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%B7%D0%B2%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%8F31\_20260127154224.png"></p>
<p>Rank 5 | 15 Total Absorbs <em>(PASSIVE)</em> <strong>Internal Corruption</strong> - Killing enemies give you +2 energy, summons get only +1 energy from killing.</p>
<p>Rank 10 <em>(+2 SP)</em> | 30 Total Absorbs <em>(ACTIVE)</em> <strong>Death Curtain</strong> - <strong>Cost</strong>: 2 | <strong>Cooldown</strong>: 6 |<br><strong>Type</strong>: Dark | <strong>Damage</strong>: 6x2 | <strong>Scaling</strong>: STR/75 + ARC/75 | <strong>Effect:</strong> Pull down a hail of projectiles upon enemy and adjacent enemies, heals 25% of max hp over 4 turns per enemy killed (6.25% per turn), capping at 2 enemies for a total of 50% MAX HP over 4 turns and give 1 energy.</p>
<p>Deal double damage if enemy has the Cursed status effect.</p>
<p><strong>NOTES:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>you only receive 3 turns of regen, not 4 (so 18.75% max hp healed per enemy, not 25%).</li>
<li>healing scales with outgoing healing.</li>
</ul>
<p><img src="https://trello.com/1/cards/67c14ee5f471dea59d5ec653/attachments/697896cced2e96dc1e495531/download/%D0%91%D0%B5%D0%B7%2B%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%B7%D0%B2%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%8F31_20260127154311.png" alt="%D0%91%D0%B5%D0%B7%2B%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%B7%D0%B2%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%8F31\_20260127154311.png"></p>
<p>Rank 15 | 75 Total Absorbs <em>(PASSIVE)</em> <strong>Dark Inversion</strong> - Dark and Hex affinity attacks deal 10% less damage to you, if they deal more than 20% of your max hp then gain 1 energy.</p>
<p><strong>NOTES:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>the dark/hex DR doesn’t work.</li>
</ul>
<p>‌</p>
<p>Rank 20 <em>(+3 SP)</em> | 105 Total Absorbs <em>(PASSIVE)</em> <strong>N/A</strong> - Grants the ability to teleport/host and fight Arkhaia</p>
