 <div itemprop="description">
 <p>Arcanium shards are consumable items that can be applied to your weapons via the Atalar NPC in Caldera (see map below):</p>
<p><img src="https://trello.com/1/cards/6826b0602258a4f14d17218a/attachments/6826b298d158785c535dc16a/download/image.png" alt="image.png"></p>
<p>Each shard applies a unique effect to your attacks.</p>
<p>There are 5 tiers of Arcanium shards (in order from strongest to weakest:</p>
<p>Radiant &gt; Pure &gt; Strong &gt; Weak &gt; Faint</p>
<p>‌</p>
<p>You can stack up to 7 (the shard slot limit for all weapons is 7) shards of the same type on a weapon. It’s important to note that the potency of a shard’s effect is reduced by ~75% after 3 shards of the same type have been put on a weapon.<br>Example (using example numbers): If one empowering shard gives a 10% dmg buff, two shards will give a combined 20% buff, but 3 shards will only give a 22.5% dmg buff because the third shard’s buff gets reduced to 2.5% instead of the usual 10%.</p>
