 <p>Obtainable by obtaining a Starpoint Charm and turning it into the Lieutenant after Quest 4. This Charm can be obtained from Shadow Bosses.</p>
<p><strong>Polaris</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Gives +20% Corrupt Energy Burn</li>
<li>Gives -20% Recoil Self Damage</li>
<li>Gives +15% Corrupt Power Gain</li>
</ul>
<p>Design: End goal is that you use <strong>Polaris</strong> to obtain your form faster, which then causes it to go away faster.</p>
