 <li itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/ListItem">
 <a itemprop="url" href="/c/OpMobWpP/1547-blasphemy"
 rel="nofollow" >
 <span itemprop="name">
 Blasphemy
 </span>
 </a>
 <div itemprop="description">
 <p><strong>Blasphemy</strong> builds and spends a resource called <strong>Notch</strong>.</p>
<p><strong>Notch cap</strong>: 2 at Phase 0-2, 3 at Phase 3-4, 4 at Phase 5.</p>
<p>Any move costing 0-2 NRG generates 1 <strong>Notch</strong>, up to your current cap. Any move costing 3+ NRG consumes your entire <strong>Notch</strong> stack instead of generating one.</p>
<p>‌</p>
<ul>
<li>Consuming <strong>Notches</strong> on a <strong>damaging</strong> move deals <strong>bonus damage</strong> (10% at 1 Notch consumed, scaling up to 30% at your <strong>Notch</strong> cap), and converts part of that damage into a temporary <strong>Shield</strong> (5% to 25%, same scaling).</li>
</ul>
<p>‌</p>
<ul>
<li>Consuming <strong>Notches</strong> on a <strong>non-damaging</strong> move grants <strong>lifesteal</strong> on your next hit (2% to 8%, same scaling), expiring after 3 turns if unused.</li>
</ul>
<p>‌</p>
<ul>
<li>Consuming <strong>Notches</strong> also reduces <strong>Recoil</strong> (10% to 30%), refunds 1 NRG per <strong>Notch</strong> consumed, and grants 15 <strong>Corrupt Power</strong> per <strong>Notch</strong> consumed.</li>
</ul>
<p>‌</p>
<p>Holding <strong>Notches</strong> costs <strong>Recoil</strong> every turn. The cost scales with how full your <strong>Notch</strong> stack is relative to your cap, and ramps up the longer you&#39;ve held it, up to +50% over 3 turns.</p>
<p><strong>Corrupt Power</strong> is also gained passively every turn, 15 per <strong>Notch</strong> you&#39;re currently holding.</p>
<p>‌</p>
<p>When your form ends, your <strong>Recoil</strong> will trigger a backlash mechanic, dealing <strong>Max Health</strong> damage to you based off of the amount of <strong>Recoil</strong> you had when losing your form. This is triggered no matter how the form ends.</p>
<p>‌</p>
