<h3>Variant 4:</h3>
<p><img src="https://trello.com/1/cards/6a8b1d2c9961e5ad8742d9cb/attachments/6a8b4c054b786e26dd236f9e/download/IMG_20260824_003732.png" alt="IMG\_20260824\_003732.png"></p>
