 <li itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/ListItem">
 <a itemprop="url" href="/c/DrBhUHv8/1548-tyranny"
 rel="nofollow" >
 <span itemprop="name">
 Tyranny
 </span>
 </a>
 <div itemprop="description">
 <p><strong>Tyranny</strong> has two stances, <strong>Tyrant</strong> and <strong>Regent</strong>.</p>
<p>You start in <strong>Tyrant</strong>.</p>
<p>‌</p>
<p>Using Strike or Magic Missile marks your target as your <strong>Subject</strong>. You can only have one <strong>Subject</strong> at a time; marking a new one releases the old one.</p>
<p><strong>Mandate</strong> builds up on your <strong>Subject</strong> as you exchange damage with it. Cap is 2 at Phase 0-2, 3 at Phase 3-4, 4 at Phase 5. The first 2 stacks are guaranteed; anything past that is a chance roll that improves with <strong>Corrupt Power</strong>.</p>
<p>Using <strong>Meditate</strong> swaps your stance and harvests all <strong>Mandate</strong> currently on your <strong>Subject</strong> into your own personal <strong>Mandate</strong> pool. This is the only pool your abilities spend from.</p>
<p><strong>Corrupt Power</strong> is gained from spending <strong>Mandate</strong> in either stance, and passively each turn, split across however many <strong>Subjects</strong> you currently have.</p>
<h2><strong>Tyrant</strong>:</h2>
<p>Entering this stance converts your harvested <strong>Mandate</strong> into a <strong>Shield</strong>.</p>
<ul>
<li>Using a move costing 2+ NRG spends 1 <strong>Mandate</strong> to apply or refresh <strong>Condemned</strong> on your target, which makes the target take more damage from anyone attacking it, not just you.</li>
</ul>
<p>‌</p>
<ul>
<li>Attacking generates <strong>Recoil</strong>; a non-attack action reduces it.</li>
</ul>
<h2><strong>Regent</strong>:</h2>
<ul>
<li>Guarding redirects a percentage of the damage your <strong>Subjects</strong> deal to your allies onto you instead, and grants a shared <strong>Damage Reduction</strong> pool across your party. <strong>Guarding</strong> also costs 1 <strong>Mandate</strong> and reduces <strong>Recoil</strong>; a successful block reduces it further.</li>
</ul>
<p>‌</p>
<ul>
<li>Using a move costing 2+ NRG spends 1 <strong>Mandate</strong> to cast <strong>King&#39;s Rally</strong>, granting your whole party a stack of <strong>Rally</strong>.</li>
</ul>
<p>‌</p>
<ul>
<li>Spending a <strong>Rally</strong> stack on an attack against your <strong>Subject</strong> grants a <strong>Shield</strong>; otherwise it grants a small passive heal each turn.</li>
</ul>
<p>‌</p>
<p>When your form ends, your <strong>Recoil</strong> will trigger a backlash mechanic, dealing <strong>Max Health</strong> damage to you based off of the amount of <strong>Recoil</strong> you had when losing your form. This is triggered no matter how the form ends.</p>
<p>‌</p>
<h2>Tyranny Variants</h2>
<h3>Variant 1:</h3>
<p>Tyrant Form:</p>
