 <div itemprop="description">
 <p>Petent Checklist: <a href="https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1Hwvddkx3hGLPzH7ar_UvIP_g68HOosQ6y9UDGWnrfcM/edit?usp=sharing" title="‌" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer ugc nofollow">[UPDATEDED] Copyable Petent Checklist</a></p>
<hr>
<h2><strong>Obtainment:</strong></h2>
<ol>
<li>Visit every location and kill every enemy/boss in the game, with a few exclusions (use the checklist above for the specifics). After completing this step whenever you hold out a void key it will glow bright pink</li>
<li>Hold out a void key (only needed while obtaining the first tier) and go behind the Church in Illustris and hug the Void Portal to safely access/check trials.</li>
<li>Defeat the enemy of the respective void trial of each area and you will be given a soul quiver, showing you’ve completed this step</li>
<li>Complete every quest within the game with a few exclusions (once again refer towards the spreadsheet)</li>
<li>Place a void key inside of the your soul vault and then wipe through whatever means you wish to</li>
<li>If all previous steps were done correctly your petent tier will be increased</li>
</ol>
<hr>
<h2><strong>Tiers:</strong></h2>
<p><strong>Tier 1</strong>, Rima:<br>Grants you the item “Rima”, which grants you the ability to teleport to a range of present locations unlocked by redoing the void trials. These portals can be used by using the item and then selecting the location name from the wheel of names which is prompts. Both you and anyone in your party can go through these portals.</p>
<p>Different teleport locations are linked to different trials, these are:</p>
<ul>
<li>Zombie Mushroom<br>Caldera</li>
<li>Sand Golem<br>Ruins<br>Blades<br>Volcano</li>
<li>Cursed Corpse<br>Deeproot<br>Westwood<br>Cessgrounds</li>
<li>Thanasian Slime<br>Church</li>
<li>Gon<br>Cult</li>
</ul>
<p>‌</p>
<p><strong>Tier 2,</strong> Conisura:</p>
<p><strong>(ACTIVE) Conisura -</strong> <em>&quot;Open a rift on an enemy, sucking out all status effects currently applied to them, then exploding dealing damage based on how many status effects were absorbed”</em><br><strong>Cost:</strong> 3 | <strong>Cooldown:</strong> 10 | <strong>Type:</strong> Magic | <strong>Damage:</strong> 7 | <strong>Scaling</strong>: STR/75 + ARC/75<br><strong>Effect:</strong> Removes all negative statuses on the target when used, increasing base damage by 3 per unique status, 6 if the status was hexed.</p>
<p><img src="https://trello.com/1/cards/67c2f3caf633ab0ca6ab3ffd/attachments/6978984d4c3facdd6ccd7db6/download/%D0%91%D0%B5%D0%B7%2B%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%B7%D0%B2%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%8F31_20260127154847.png" alt="%D0%91%D0%B5%D0%B7%2B%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%B7%D0%B2%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%8F31\_20260127154847.png"></p>
<p>‌</p>
<p><strong>Tier 3,</strong> Dominioneer:<br>Decreases all environmental damage by a bit, however this is completely bugged and does not work</p>
<p><strong>Innate Tier 5 abilities:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>You can fight the void trials whenever you wish to now</li>
<li>Once finishing a void trial, the locations bound to that trial are now permanent on that character and persist throughout wipes (you can use the portals for that location whenever you want, regardless of if you’ve done trials or not)</li>
</ul>
 </div>
 </li>
