 <div itemprop="description">
 <p><a href="https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1h6ALuiPMYB5MhTDHZLywYA8EI-A_ilp9-JszwMLN00k/edit?gid=0#gid=0" title="smartCard-inline" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer ugc nofollow">https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1h6ALuiPMYB5MhTDHZLywYA8EI-A_ilp9-JszwMLN00k/edit?gid=0#gid=0</a></p>
<hr>
<h2><strong>Obtainment:</strong></h2>
<ol>
<li>Obtain <a href="https://trello.com/c/ww3PAVCd/67-midas" title="smartCard-inline">https://trello.com/c/ww3PAVCd/67-midas</a></li>
<li>Sell Resplendent Essence, Memory Fragment, Soul Dust, Lineage Shard and Phoenix Tear in no particular order, this will give you a soul quiver if done properly</li>
<li>Obtain 50k gold (you do not need 50k gold while selling the lesser artifacts)</li>
<li>Sacrifice Artifacts to each of the 4 venia orbs around the map, each orb will consume 3 artifacts in total, if an artifact is not used or it is broken then it does not want this artifact (The artifacts it wants will persist throughout all wipes)<br>The artifacts that can be sacrifice include:<br><strong>Lesser Artifacts:</strong> Memory Fragment, Soul Dust, Lineage Shard, Phoenix Tear, Resplendent essence, Void Key, Echo Shard<br><strong>Yar’thul:</strong> Reality Watch, Narthanas Sigil, Shifting Hourglass<br><strong>Thorian:</strong> Darksigil, Metrom’s Amulet, Stellian Core<br><strong>Metrom’s Vessel + Other:</strong> Chaos Orb, Skyward Totem<ul>
<li><em>The locations of each of the orbs are listed below.</em></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>After doing so, wipe while still having the midas enchant and 50k gold on you (you previously needed to have the “Objects of Power” but this has been disproven)</li>
</ol>
<hr>
<h2><strong>Tiers:</strong></h2>
<p><strong>Tier 1,</strong> Muto:<br>Grants you the item “Muto”, this allows you to sell various artifacts for “Primal Essence” and then purchase other ones, however the ratio between the buy to sell of most items is 1:3.5 (e.g Darksigil sells for 100 essence and can be bought for 350). This essence will persist on the slot through wipes.</p>
<p>The prices of each artifact can be found below:</p>
<p>Memory Fragment/Soul Dust [ 10 Sell | 35 Buy ]<br>Resplendent Essence/Darksigil [ 100 Sell | 350 Buy ]<br>Shifting Hourglass [ 100 Sell | 245 Buy ]<br>Reality Watch/Narthana’s Sigil [ 80 Sell | 280 Buy ]<br>Metrom&#39;s Amulet [ 180 Sell | 630 Buy ]<br>Skyward Totem [ 350 sell | 1025 Buy ]<br>Heaven&#39;s Authority [ 400 sell ]<br>Lineage Shard [ 120 sell ]</p>
<p><strong>Tier 2,</strong> Permuth:</p>
<p><strong>(ACTIVE) Permuth -</strong> “<em>Exchange 5% of your health into a random 40% stat buff for 3 turns, has weighting towards invested stats. Fails if you don’t have enough health</em>”<br><strong>Cost:</strong> 2 | <strong>Duration:</strong> 2 | <strong>Cooldown:</strong> 10 | <strong>Type:</strong> Magic | <strong>Effect:</strong> Consumes 5% of your hp and increases a random stat by 40%, has a ~50% chance to increase your highest invested stat and a ~50% chance to increase another stat instead. Buffs towards the “Endurance” stat will result in a defense buff</p>
<p>Note: Stats inside the brackets of your stats are not included in stat buffs</p>
<p><img src="https://trello.com/1/cards/67c2f3cde91e26bd11540f15/attachments/697898d91022e8aec0bfecbc/download/%D0%91%D0%B5%D0%B7%2B%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%B7%D0%B2%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%8F31_20260127154927.png" alt="%D0%91%D0%B5%D0%B7%2B%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%B7%D0%B2%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%8F31\_20260127154927.png"></p>
<p><strong>Tier 3,</strong> Venian:<br>When finishing a fight, you will be given gold that is equal to 5x of your level. Your level is the only factor which affects the gold you receive</p>
<hr>
<p><em><strong>Venia Orb Locations</strong></em></p>
<p><img src="https://trello.com/1/cards/68c66badada900cdf4b8d23c/attachments/68ca73704845df4c9808ca86/download/image.png" alt="image.png"></p>
<p>Caldera Orb, it can be found nearby the fists base class trainer at spawn</p>
<p>‌</p>
<p><img src="https://trello.com/1/cards/68c66badada900cdf4b8d23c/attachments/68ca7389f1052f915b1da968/download/image.png" alt="image.png"></p>
<p>Blades Orb, it can be found outside of the Blades of the World location on a path between two sides of the ravine</p>
<p>‌</p>
<p><img src="https://trello.com/1/cards/68c66badada900cdf4b8d23c/attachments/68ca73a7a8ea5d67a3dfcb48/download/image.png" alt="image.png"></p>
<p>Deeproot Orb, it can be found nearby the entrance into the Deeproot Caverns</p>
<p>‌</p>
<p><img src="https://trello.com/1/cards/68c66badada900cdf4b8d23c/attachments/68ca73d5e3c3a489179f1124/download/image.png" alt="image.png"></p>
<p>Icerift Orb, it can be found next to the locked door to Icerift inside Icerift Approach</p>
 </div>
 </li>
 <li itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/ListItem">
 <a itemprop="url" href="/c/agiZ9CZk/301-astra"
 rel="nofollow" >
 <span itemprop="name">
 Astra
 </span>
 </a>
 <div itemprop="description">
 <p>Astra Checklist: <a href="https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1D9xj6BdpXtyZcfo_tea446VIxm0OwP5jugJdLsgc5TM/edit?gid=0#gid=0" title="smartCard-inline" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer ugc nofollow">https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1D9xj6BdpXtyZcfo_tea446VIxm0OwP5jugJdLsgc5TM/edit?gid=0#gid=0</a></p>
<hr>
<h2><strong>Obtainment:</strong></h2>
<p>a. Obtain 5 <a href="https://trello.com/c/quL9z4zd/773-astral-shards" title="smartCard-inline">https://trello.com/c/quL9z4zd/773-astral-shards</a>, a stellian core and 15k</p>
<p>b. Go to <a href="https://trello.com/c/k0vu6XDz/189-the-forgotten-sanctum" title="smartCard-inline">https://trello.com/c/k0vu6XDz/189-the-forgotten-sanctum</a> and talk to El’heith, who will craft the Celestial Emblem for you</p>
<p>c. Defeat the following enemies while you have Celestial Emblem equipped, make sure that a player with Celestial Emblem is the one who initiates the fight</p>
<ul>
<li>Astral: Star Slime</li>
<li>Crossing: Goblin, Thanasludd, Gon</li>
<li>Desert: Night Raider, Duneguard</li>
<li>Deeproot: Sentient Darkness, Ptoruco</li>
</ul>
<p>d. Defeat Arkhaia, make sure you start the fight or someone with Celestial Emblem while you also have Celestial Emblem</p>
<p>e. Wipe while having Celestial Emblem Equipped</p>
<hr>
<h2><strong>Tiers:</strong></h2>
<p><strong>Tier 1</strong>, Starborn:<br>Whenever you crit or apply a status effect you will spawn a miniature star, you can have 8 stars in total and they are used for the moves you gain at later tiers</p>
<p>‌</p>
<p><strong>Tier 2,</strong> Edo:</p>
<p><strong>(ACTIVE) Edo -</strong> &quot;Activate your constellation with at least 5 sparks, granting your team a random positive effect.”<br><strong>Cost:</strong> 1 | <strong>Cooldown:</strong> 8 | <strong>Type:</strong> Magic | <strong>Duration:</strong> 5<br><strong>Effect:</strong> Consumes 5+ stars to give everyone on the team a random positive effect (cleanse, heal, speed, defense, enchant proc chance)</p>
<p><img src="https://trello.com/1/cards/67c2f3cfa9460f3f089beb7a/attachments/69789bb19879fb04c0f15530/download/%D0%91%D0%B5%D0%B7%2B%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%B7%D0%B2%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%8F31_20260127160327.png" alt="%D0%91%D0%B5%D0%B7%2B%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%B7%D0%B2%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%8F31\_20260127160327.png"></p>
<p>‌</p>
<p><strong>Tier 3,</strong> Utor:</p>
<p><strong>(ACTIVE) Utor -</strong> &quot;Consume 2 sparks of your constellation, instantly restoring some health and energy”<br><strong>Cost:</strong> 1 | <strong>Cooldown:</strong> 7 | <strong>Type:</strong> Magic<br><strong>Effect:</strong> Use 2-4 stars to restore 20%, 33%, or 40% of your max hp and grant you 2 energy if used at max stars. Affected by both Incoming and Outgoing heal stats.</p>
<p><img src="https://trello.com/1/cards/67c2f3cfa9460f3f089beb7a/attachments/69789bb279be04ca19c84ad2/download/%D0%91%D0%B5%D0%B7%2B%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%B7%D0%B2%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%8F31_20260127160357.png" alt="%D0%91%D0%B5%D0%B7%2B%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%B7%D0%B2%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%8F31\_20260127160357.png"></p>
