 <li itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/ListItem">
 <a itemprop="url" href="/c/rvLYtGnk/452-starter-quest-daze"
 rel="nofollow" >
 <span itemprop="name">
 Starter Quest (Daze)
 </span>
 </a>
 <div itemprop="description">
 <p>The NPC named Yorn, located in the center of Caldera to welcome new Lightmarkeds.</p>
<p>If you are under level 4, you can ask him for help. He will give you a quest to kill 3 Slimes. If you are level 4 or higher, you can still get the quest, but you will also have the option to buy the skill for <strong>250g</strong>. Both options count toward Petent mark requirements.</p>
<p>If you choose to complete the quest and return to him, he will reward you with 30g, 1 Abhorrent Elixir, the Self Cure skill, and the Daze skill. If you choose to buy the skill, you will only receive the Self Cure and Daze skills.</p>
<p><strong>(ACTIVE) Daze - Cost:</strong> 2 | <strong>Cooldown:</strong> 5 | <strong>Type:</strong> Physical | <strong>Category:</strong> Attack | <strong>Damage:</strong> 9 | <strong>Scaling</strong>: STR/75 | <strong>Effect:</strong> Applies 2 Weakened.</p>
<p><img src="https://trello.com/1/cards/684a9d6dac6f8482bb859ba2/attachments/698c4237cfc9156185b0d8db/download/%D0%91%D0%B5%D0%B7%2B%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%B7%D0%B2%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%8F31_20260211134511.png" alt="image.png"></p>
 </div>
 </li>
 <li itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/ListItem">
 <a itemprop="url" href="/c/NKksYmvd/459-potion-help-orderly-chaotic"
 rel="nofollow" >
 <span itemprop="name">
 Potion Help (Orderly/Chaotic)
 </span>
 </a>
 <div itemprop="description">
 <p>The NPC named Byfra, who is located on the balcony near the Blacksmith, asks you to help him with his alchemy and requests that you bring him a Small Healing Potion. There are two possible outcomes to this quest:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Give him the right potion</p>
</blockquote>
<p>If you give him a Small Healing Potion, he will reward you with 50g and ? amount of Orderly alignment.<br><a href="https://trello.com/c/zUuAi0E1">https://trello.com/c/zUuAi0E1</a></p>
<blockquote>
<p>Give him the wrong potion</p>
</blockquote>
<p>If you give him an Abhorrent Elixir, he will reward you with 50g and ? amount of Chaotic alignment.<br><a href="https://trello.com/c/kPCUxce8">https://trello.com/c/kPCUxce8</a> (Alternatively, it can be purchased from the potion shop at spawn)</p>
<p>Regardless of your choice, both options count toward Petent mark requirements</p>
 </div>
 </li>
 <li itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/ListItem">
 <a itemprop="url" href="/c/F4vm7Fgu/453-guild-request-help"
 rel="nofollow" >
 <span itemprop="name">
 Guild Request Help
 </span>
 </a>
 <div itemprop="description">
 <p>The NPC named Horiya, who sits behind the Bank building, asks if you can help with a Guild request. If you accept, she asks you to bring her a Sand Core. Returning with the Sand Core and giving it to her rewards you with 30g and <a href="https://trello.com/c/j1TKlpAn/428-everbeating-drums" title="smartCard-inline">https://trello.com/c/j1TKlpAn/428-everbeating-drums</a></p>
<p>Sand Cores drop from Sand Elementals at a chance</p>
 </div>
 </li>
 <li itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/ListItem">
 <a itemprop="url" href="/c/Svbbtdhe/454-delivery-quest-orderly"
 rel="nofollow" >
 <span itemprop="name">
 Delivery Quest (Orderly)
 </span>
 </a>
 <div itemprop="description">
 <p>The NPC named Poira, who stands in front of the Merchant building, asks if you can deliver a package to their friend Jeith. If you accept, you are tasked with going to the Old Ruins to give the package to Jeith. Completing the quest rewards you with 40g, 1 Small Healing Potion, 1 Abhorrent Elixir, and ? amount of Orderly alignment.<br><strong>Note:</strong> Talking to Jeith completes the quest, you do not need to return to the original NPC.</p>
<p>The Jeith in question shown below</p>
<p><img src="https://trello.com/1/cards/684a9f8428915f872e9ea17b/attachments/684a9fefd07a8d75d9d0cb76/download/image.png" alt="image.png"></p>
 </div>
 </li>
 <li itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/ListItem">
 <a itemprop="url" href="/c/MUkwAbzQ/977-midas-quest"
 rel="nofollow" >
 <span itemprop="name">
 Midas Quest
 </span>
 </a>
 <div itemprop="description">
 <p><strong>NOTE: THIS QUEST IS NOT NEEDED FOR</strong> <a href="https://trello.com/c/bxiVnmOw/299-petent" title="smartCard-inline">https://trello.com/c/bxiVnmOw/299-petent</a></p>
<p>The NPC named Lodyssa, located at the Calderan Tavern and gives you the quest to obtain <a href="https://trello.com/c/ww3PAVCd/67-midas" title="smartCard-inline">https://trello.com/c/ww3PAVCd/67-midas</a>, you need to fight Yar’thul on that slot before being able to obtain the quest.</p>
<p>The goal of the quest is to sell 200 items to the merchant. Anything that can be sold to the merchant counts toward the quest. Below are some sample dialogues showing your progress:</p>
<p>‌</p>
<ul>
<li>if you sold less than 51 items (0% Progress)</li>
</ul>
<p>Let me take a look here.. its seems you&#39;ve only started, your fortune is one you have to make yourself, keep at it though! </p>
<p>‌</p>
<ul>
<li>if you sold 51+ items (25% Progress)</li>
</ul>
<p>Let me take a look here.. You&#39;re getting there, your fortune is one you have to make yourself, keep at it!</p>
<p>‌</p>
<ul>
<li>if you sold 101+ items (50% Progress)</li>
</ul>
<p>Let me take a look here.. You&#39;re almost there, your fortune is one you have to make yourself, keep at it!</p>
<p>‌</p>
<ul>
<li>if you sold 200 items (100% Progress)</li>
</ul>
<p>Let me take a look here.. Ah, yes now that is quite the fortune you have there. Well then, i think you&#39;re worthy now. What do you say about receiving a blessing from a deity?</p>
 </div>
 </li>
 <li itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/ListItem">
 <a itemprop="url" href="/c/OCFDlIzW/455-crossing-quests"
 rel="nofollow" >
 <span itemprop="name">
 Crossing Quests
 </span>
 </a>
 <div itemprop="description">
 <p>hi</p>
 </div>
 </li>
 <li itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/ListItem">
 <a itemprop="url" href="/c/y4NWN50X/456-spare-gold"
 rel="nofollow" >
 <span itemprop="name">
 Spare Gold?
 </span>
 </a>
 <div itemprop="description">
 <p>The NPC named Kuur, who is located in the forest on the desert side, asks if you can spare them some gold. If you accept, you will be forced to give all your gold to them in exchange for the “Weird Accessory,” so it is recommended to trade your gold to an alt beforehand.</p>
<p><strong>Weird Accessory:</strong> An equippable cosmetic item that makes all damage taken 50% more than usual.</p>
 </div>
 </li>
 <li itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/ListItem">
 <a itemprop="url" href="/c/hwC6phF5/457-sky-man-quest-church-unlock"
 rel="nofollow" >
 <span itemprop="name">
 Sky Man Quest (Church Unlock)
 </span>
 </a>
 <div itemprop="description">
 <p>The NPC named Lorra, who is located in the forest in the right corner of the Deeproot side, asks if you can help reactivate the portal behind them. If you accept, you are tasked with obtaining 1 Sand Core, 1 Mushroom Cap, and 1 Rot Core.</p>
<p>Finishing this quest then allows you to enter <a href="https://trello.com/c/kQjhzfBV/381-illustris" title="smartCard-inline">https://trello.com/c/kQjhzfBV/381-illustris</a> where you can also find <a href="https://trello.com/c/wJJIU1Wo/245-church-of-raphion" title="smartCard-inline">https://trello.com/c/wJJIU1Wo/245-church-of-raphion</a></p>
 </div>
 </li>
 <li itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/ListItem">
 <a itemprop="url" href="/c/Hssk2H7s/458-desert-quests"
 rel="nofollow" >
 <span itemprop="name">
 Desert Quests
 </span>
 </a>
 </li>
 <li itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/ListItem">
 <a itemprop="url" href="/c/csOlHVG1/474-looking-for-help-orderly-chaotic"
 rel="nofollow" >
 <span itemprop="name">
 Looking For Help (Orderly/Chaotic)
 </span>
 </a>
 <div itemprop="description">
 <p>The NPC named Tiso, who is located in the Old Ruins, asks you to help his friend Selivus, who has a bounty on his head and is currently in the Volcano. There are two possible outcomes to this quest:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Give his friend a Minor Energy Elixir</p>
</blockquote>
<p>If you choose to help his friend and give him a Minor Energy Elixir, return to the original NPC afterward. He will reward you with 200g and ? amount of Orderly alignment.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Kill his friend</p>
</blockquote>
<p>If you choose to kill his friend, go to the <a href="https://trello.com/c/SrxXuLEY">https://trello.com/c/SrxXuLEY</a> afterward and speak with the covenant leader Ryzar to claim the bounty. He will reward you with 500g and ? amount of Chaotic alignment.<br><strong>Note:</strong> Returning to the original NPC in this scenario is unnecessary, as he will only learn of his friend’s death and provide no additional reward.</p>
<p>Regardless of your choice, both options count toward Petent mark requirements</p>
<p><img src="https://trello.com/1/cards/68666bdbb0adac866471ca5b/attachments/68666d8bcfa1dcca3fbbcd51/download/image.png" alt="image.png"></p>
 </div>
 </li>
 <li itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/ListItem">
 <a itemprop="url" href="/c/y2ZGhuk6/1486-ramizcas-trial"
 rel="nofollow" >
 <span itemprop="name">
 Ramizca&#39;s Trial
 </span>
 </a>
 <div itemprop="description">
 <p><strong>NOTE: This quest is NOT needed for Petent</strong></p>
<p>‌</p>
<p>The NPC named Thuriaz, who is located near the <a href="https://trello.com/c/SrxXuLEY" title="smartCard-inline">https://trello.com/c/SrxXuLEY</a> Covenant in the Desert Caves. Tasks with defeating 100 desert enemies. Once completed, talk to him again to receive the <a href="https://trello.com/c/7zIhUU3k" title="smartCard-inline">https://trello.com/c/7zIhUU3k</a>.</p>
 </div>
 </li>
 <li itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/ListItem">
 <a itemprop="url" href="/c/EG4GDWzU/475-bone-man-quest"
 rel="nofollow" >
 <span itemprop="name">
 Bone Man Quest
 </span>
 </a>
 <div itemprop="description">
 <p>The NPC named Lyothis, who is located at the entrance of the Volcano, asks you to explore the desert and collect four different bones scattered throughout the area. After completing the task, he rewards you with the <a href="https://trello.com/c/J4kXQFda/338-dragon-memoir" title="smartCard-inline">https://trello.com/c/J4kXQFda/338-dragon-memoir</a></p>
<p>Locations:</p>
<p><img src="https://trello.com/1/cards/68666e4e4606fa7e1950dd4c/attachments/68666fd8aea7c8ada9479e8c/download/image.png" alt="image.png"></p>
<p>^Right of the entrance to volcano if you’re walking into in in the corner</p>
<p><img src="https://trello.com/1/cards/68666e4e4606fa7e1950dd4c/attachments/6866704821dc9fe5be2209f7/download/image.png" alt="image.png"></p>
<p>^Into the entrance to ruins nearby the rock that’s farther away</p>
<p><img src="https://trello.com/1/cards/68666e4e4606fa7e1950dd4c/attachments/68667095b0676709a843b202/download/image.png" alt="image.png"></p>
<p>^Left of the bard building in the corner</p>
<p><img src="https://trello.com/1/cards/68666e4e4606fa7e1950dd4c/attachments/6866710d1606f178dcc237bf/download/image.png" alt="image.png"></p>
<p>^in the corner of the ravine on the same side you enter blades of the world all the way at the end</p>
