 rel="nofollow" >
 <span itemprop="name">
 Push a guy off a bridge (Chaotic)
 </span>
 </a>
 <div itemprop="description">
 <p>The NPC named Krit, who is located in Westwood Heart, sits on the bridge between the second and third platforms. Pushing him off will reward you with ? amount of Chaotic alignment.</p>
 </div>
 </li>
 <li itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/ListItem">
 <a itemprop="url" href="/c/alWGXzly/478-leaf-man-quest"
 rel="nofollow" >
 <span itemprop="name">
 Leaf Man Quest
 </span>
 </a>
 <div itemprop="description">
 <p>The NPC named Tae’el, who is located on the balcony of Westwood’s second platform, tasks you with going to <a href="https://trello.com/c/k0vu6XDz/189-the-forgotten-sanctum" title="smartCard-inline">https://trello.com/c/k0vu6XDz/189-the-forgotten-sanctum</a> Upon doing so, you will receive <a href="https://trello.com/c/CSyh8Px5/336-narthanas-leaf-bugged" title="smartCard-inline">https://trello.com/c/CSyh8Px5/336-narthanas-leaf-bugged</a> and the quest will be completed.</p>
 </div>
