 <li itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/ListItem">
 <a itemprop="url" href="/c/6JObRdcw/480-potion-help-v2-chaotic"
 rel="nofollow" >
 <span itemprop="name">
 Potion Help v2 (Chaotic)
 </span>
 </a>
 <div itemprop="description">
 <p>The NPC named Velizo, who is located in the abandoned house in front of Westwood Heart, asks you to bring him 2 Slime Chunks and 1 Cryastem. Upon completion, he will reward you with 50g, 1 Minor Energy Elixir, and ? amount of Chaotic alignment.</p>
 </div>
 </li>
 <li itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/ListItem">
 <a itemprop="url" href="/c/VvILAFy1/481-potion-help-v2-orderly"
 rel="nofollow" >
 <span itemprop="name">
 Potion Help v2 (Orderly)
 </span>
 </a>
 <div itemprop="description">
 <p>The NPC named Trian, who is located in the house at the entrance of Westwood’s third platform, asks you to bring him 3 Carnastools. Upon completion, he will reward you with 20g and ? amount of Orderly alignment.</p>
 </div>
 </li>
 <li itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/ListItem">
 <a itemprop="url" href="/c/EYfzrDOH/482-crylight-quest-chaotic"
 rel="nofollow" >
 <span itemprop="name">
 Crylight Quest (Chaotic)
 </span>
 </a>
 <div itemprop="description">
 <p>The NPC named Diiz, who is located on the balcony of Westwood’s first platform, asks if you can obtain a Crylight to help him. Upon completion, he will reward you with 400g, 1 Invisibility Potion, and ? amount of Chaotic alignment.</p>
 </div>
 </li>
 <li itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/ListItem">
 <a itemprop="url" href="/c/SlC9tUA3/483-crylight-quest-orderly"
 rel="nofollow" >
 <span itemprop="name">
 Crylight Quest (Orderly)
 </span>
 </a>
 <div itemprop="description">
 <p>The NPC named Pheend, who is located inside the <a href="https://trello.com/c/umfjhJub">https://trello.com/c/umfjhJub</a> building on Westwood’s third platform, asks if you can obtain a Crylight to help him. Upon completion, he will reward you with 400g, 1 Invisibility Potion, and ? amount of Orderly alignment.</p>
 </div>
 </li>
 <li itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/ListItem">
 <a itemprop="url" href="/c/deRuoMBk/771-cursed-corpse-cleansing"
 rel="nofollow" >
 <span itemprop="name">
 Cursed Corpse Cleansing
 </span>
 </a>
 <div itemprop="description">
 <p><strong>NOTE: THIS QUEST IS NOT NEEDED FOR</strong> <a href="https://trello.com/c/bxiVnmOw/299-petent" title="smartCard-inline">https://trello.com/c/bxiVnmOw/299-petent</a></p>
<p>You interact with a cursed corpse named Jyphar, who tasks you with killing 10 cursed corpses. These corpses must be killed by the player doing the quest, kills by party members will not count toward your progress.</p>
<p>After completing this step, start and finish a fight while having the Cursed status effect on you (you must end the fight by killing the enemies, this cannot be done through PvP). The best way to become cursed is to get hit by a Venom Shroom using Toxic Burst while having at least 1 Poison stack on yourself, which applies 2 stacks of Cursed.</p>
<p>After finishing a fight while cursed, run into a Cess Anomaly in Cessgrounds and “die” to it. If you followed the steps correctly, you will be granted the enchantment.</p>
 </div>
 </li>
 <li itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/ListItem">
 <a itemprop="url" href="/c/pCTg9tLD/978-lifesong-quest"
 rel="nofollow" >
 <span itemprop="name">
 Lifesong Quest
 </span>
 </a>
 <div itemprop="description">
 <p><strong>NOTE: THIS QUEST IS NOT NEEDED FOR</strong> <a href="https://trello.com/c/bxiVnmOw/299-petent" title="smartCard-inline">https://trello.com/c/bxiVnmOw/299-petent</a></p>
<p>The NPC named Narthana, who manifests as a large tree in the Deeproot Depths, asks if you are interested in a piece of her power in exchange for completing a quest.</p>
<p>The goal of the quest is to heal other players for a total of 5000 HP. Healing yourself or healing outside of combat does not count, while overhealing and healing summons do count. Below are some sample dialogues showing your progress: </p>
<p>‌</p>
<ul>
<li>if you healed less than 1250 HP (0% progression)</li>
</ul>
<p>Hmm, I&#39;m afraid not, keep doing good deeds and soothing the souls of many, and perhaps one day you will be ready. </p>
<p>‌</p>
<ul>
<li>if you healed 1250+ HP (25% progression)</li>
</ul>
<p>Hmm, you’re improving but still far off, keep doing good deeds and soothing the souls of many, and perhaps one day you will be ready. </p>
<p>‌</p>
<ul>
<li>if you healed 2500+ HP (50% progression)</li>
</ul>
<p>Hmm, you’re getting there, keep doing good deeds and soothing the souls of many, and perhaps one day you will be ready. </p>
<p>‌</p>
<ul>
<li>if you healed 3750+ HP (75% progression)</li>
</ul>
<p>Hmm, you’re almost there, keep doing good deeds and soothing the souls of many, and perhaps one day you will be ready. </p>
<p>‌</p>
<ul>
<li>if you healed 5000 HP (100% progression)</li>
</ul>
<p>Ah yes, I can feel the beauty of your soul even in my weakened state. My name is Narthana, are you ready for my gift?.</p>
 </div>
 </li>
 <li itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/ListItem">
 <a itemprop="url" href="/c/c0B2cngw/479-torruns-final-request"
 rel="nofollow" >
 <span itemprop="name">
 Tor&#39;run&#39;s final request
 </span>
 </a>
 <div itemprop="description">
 <p>Tor’run tasks you to take a flower for him from cessgrounds all the way to a graveyard of their close friend’s grave to the right of the entrance to volcano. Going back Tor’run will give you the <a href="https://trello.com/c/a30TPzE1/64-vastic-glaive" title="smartCard-inline">https://trello.com/c/a30TPzE1/64-vastic-glaive</a></p>
<p>‌</p>
<p><img src="https://trello.com/1/cards/68667690243b803206e0146b/attachments/686678a1fe061e1bab61c53d/download/image.png" alt="image.png"></p>
 </div>
 </li>
 </ol>
 </div>
