 <div itemprop="description">
 <h3>Topic: Testing of buff potions</h3>
<p>Personnel in charge: hud, matt, fruit<br>test subject name: hud (volunteering)</p>
<p>Setup:<br>Use soul dust to remove any factors that could interfere<br>Race: estella<br>stat: Str 2 (0) or 101.3% physical<br>Class: Chad (baseless)<br>weapon type: None (throw hands)</p>
<hr>
<h2>Procedure</h2>
<ul>
<li>Ensure subject has been soul dusted as mention earlier</li>
<li>Subject is to use default armor and no weapon</li>
<li>Subject is to engage in a 1v1 combat against scps (mobs)</li>
<li>Other Personnel not part of the combat should stand as spectators in case results are difficult to collect</li>
<li>while in combat, subject will have to drink a potion depending on its functions and engage with scps to gather results</li>
<li>repeat same potion 5 times for accuracy and sample purposes</li>
<li>drink other potions and repeat again</li>
<li>take down results and compare said results to the Trello for accuracy checks</li>
<li>before doing potions, subject should do a damage check as a base value</li>
</ul>
<p>base damage: 5.1<br>base damage taken: 5 (smack from slime)</p>
