 <span itemprop="name">
 Surprise Package
 </span>
 </a>
 <div itemprop="description">
 <p>Can be used by <a href="https://trello.com/c/X2cGdbOn/151-thief" title="smartCard-inline">https://trello.com/c/X2cGdbOn/151-thief</a> and <a href="https://trello.com/c/lwFSv3n7/152-martial-artist" title="smartCard-inline">https://trello.com/c/lwFSv3n7/152-martial-artist</a></p>
<p><strong>(ACTIVE) Surprise Package</strong> - Cost: 2 | Cooldown: 11 | Type: Physical | Effect: Plant a bomb on a target for 3 turns, they take 30% (5% for bosses) of their max hp in those 3 turns then the bomb will explode, having differing effects based on the affinity of the move which triggered it. (Can&#39;t Stack)</p>
<p><img src="https://trello.com/1/cards/67e3e181a0ad57536d287093/attachments/697f62771539a9fe651351ff/download/%D0%91%D0%B5%D0%B7%2B%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%B7%D0%B2%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%8F31_20260201184532.png" alt="image.png"></p>
<ul>
<li>Physical/Magic -&gt; 35% of damage dealt is added as extra damage to the current enemy.</li>
<li>Fire -&gt; 15% of damage dealt is added as extra fire damage to the current enemy. Inflicts 10 Burning.</li>
<li>Holy -&gt; Grants 1 Resist to all party members and heals them for 10% of their max HP.</li>
<li>Ice -&gt; Inflicts 6 Cold on all enemies and reduces their defense by 5% for 4 turns.</li>
<li>Poison -&gt; Inflicts 20 Poison and applies 2 Weaken to all enemies.</li>
<li>Hex -&gt; Applies 1 Hex and deals 100 true damage to the enemy.</li>
<li>Dark -&gt; Applies 3 vulnerable and 3 weakened and disables dodging for mobs for 4 turns.</li>
<li>Nature -&gt; Triggers Daminos Restructure for the entire party and fully removes one random negative status from each party member.</li>
</ul>
