 <p>An amalgamation of soul of stone, the Handaconda lies as the creation of the demise of the souls of those deceased from the ruin of Ramizca. Together their souls, their screams and their agony forge the strength of the Hand</p>
<hr>
<h2><strong>Stats</strong></h2>
<p>Health - 9,000<br>Regen - 75<br>CRIT% - 20%<br>NRG% - ?</p>
