<li><a href="https://trello.com/c/05Y2QGK6/1105-primordial" title="smartCard-inline">https://trello.com/c/05Y2QGK6/1105-primordial</a></li>
</ul>
<p>‌</p>
<h2><strong>Passives</strong></h2>
<p>[Trial of the Handaconda] - Literally just play Rock Paper Scissors vs a big hand</p>
<blockquote>
<ul>
<li>Your Escape option within this encounter now goes into another UI, allowing you to pick between 3 different options<ul>
<li>Rock</li>
<li>Paper</li>
<li>Scissors</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>Upon picking one of these options, Handaconda will also pick an option, the following happens depending on the outcome<ul>
<li>Win: Apply 2T of Stun onto Handaconda</li>
<li>Draw: Play again</li>
<li>Lose: Apply 2T of Heavy Stun onto the player who lost and give Handaconda 6 NRG</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
</blockquote>
<p>‌</p>
<p>[3 Sides of the Same Hand] - Handaconda splits his abilities into 3 different forms</p>
<blockquote>
<ul>
<li>Rock grants Handaconda large amounts of DR, heavily decreasing incoming dmaage</li>
<li>Paper applies 2 Resist onto Handaconda every turn<ul>
<li>Handaconda can negate statuses he may apply onto himself (e.g Stun)</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>Scissors grants Handaconda 2 NRG every turn instead of 1</li>
</ul>
<p>Within each form, Handaconda will have different movesets, aside from [One More Time], which he can access within all modes</p>
</blockquote>
<p>‌</p>
<p>[Adaptive Armor] - Upon taking a hit that deals significant damage, gain heavy DR</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Heavily increases the TrueDR of Handaconda for its next turn</p>
<p>uhh idk</p>
</blockquote>
<p>‌</p>
<p>[Corrupt Awakening] - Heavily enhance Handaconda while Corrupted</p>
<blockquote>
<ul>
<li>Instead of having 1.5x HP, Handaconda will instead have 3x HP<ul>
<li>This leads to 27,000 HP</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>Handaconda’s attacks within Paper will apply 10T of Soulless per hit</li>
</ul>
</blockquote>
<p>‌</p>
<h2><strong>Actives</strong></h2>
<h4><em><strong>Universal</strong></em></h4>
<p>[One More Time] - <em>“…”</em><br>0 NRG | 8T CD | Holy<br>Self-Target | Utility</p>
<blockquote>
<ul>
<li>Swap Handaconda’s form to one which he is not in currently</li>
<li>Apply an unnamed status onto himself, raising his dmg by 5% per stack on him</li>
</ul>
</blockquote>
<p>‌</p>
<h4><em><strong>Rock Stance</strong></em></h4>
<p>[Crushing Lunge] - <em>“…”</em><br>0 NRG | 0T CD | Physical | 35 DMG<br>Single-Target | Melee | Dodgeable and Blockable</p>
<blockquote>
<ul>
<li>Applies 3T of Sunder when this move is blocked or lands on an opponent</li>
<li>If the player targeted is Sundered, this move is impossible to Block or Dodge<ul>
