 <li itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/ListItem">
 <a itemprop="url" href="/c/9Lhj7mP0/792-the-dealer"
 rel="nofollow" >
 <span itemprop="name">
 The Dealer
 </span>
 </a>
 <div itemprop="description">
 <p><em><strong>Here for some spelldraw I see? Alright then, state your bet. I won’t do anything below 50.</strong></em></p>
<p>‌</p>
<p>This NPC can be found in <a href="https://trello.com/c/QcWAbkee/191-caldera-town" title="smartCard-inline">https://trello.com/c/QcWAbkee/191-caldera-town</a>, <a href="https://trello.com/c/U5iaBJhB/434-westwood-heart" title="smartCard-inline">https://trello.com/c/U5iaBJhB/434-westwood-heart</a> and at the Tavern which the Bard plays at in <a href="https://trello.com/c/YLY4BgOI/194-waving-sands" title="smartCard-inline">https://trello.com/c/YLY4BgOI/194-waving-sands</a></p>
<p>Allows you to bet gold against the dealer in a game of <em>Spelldraw</em>. You need to bet at least 50 gold to be able to play.<br>This game works the same as real life blackjack, you need to get as close to 21 without going over it. You will be given 2 cards to start off and you have 3 different options on your turn:</p>
<ul>
<li>Hit, draw another card and be capable of moving on your next turn</li>
<li>Stand, keep your current cards, you forfeit all future turns</li>
<li>Double, draw another card, place whatever amount of gold you originally bet into the pool, while doubling your rewards if you win. You forfeit all future turns</li>
</ul>
<p>Winning will give you your money back twofold and winning through the double option will give you your money back fourfold</p>
