 <li itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/ListItem">
 <a itemprop="url" href="/c/WAX3l4rC/11-inner-machinations-of-regeneration"
 rel="nofollow" >
 <span itemprop="name">
 Inner Machinations of Regeneration
 </span>
 </a>
 <div itemprop="description">
 <p>Regen. works on one very fun principle; &quot;Regen never overheals you&quot;</p>
<p>When it IS supposed to Overheal you, what it does instead is it starts taking away the Regen. Buffs.<br>so stuff like Blessing Of Life Regen. Buff, then incoming Healing Buff, and etc.<br><strong>[Until it doesn&#39;t overheal you.]</strong></p>
<p>The incoming healing buff takeaway is something you normally wouldn&#39;t notice<br>(Since you just take away percents until it doesn&#39;t overheal).<br>What <em>is</em> noticeable is the [Blessing of Life] takeaway. A turn you could heal 8 and next you heal heal 16. (Tested with 20 Missing HP)</p>
<p><strong>‼ STILL NEEDS MORE TESTING ‼</strong></p>
 </div>
