 <div itemprop="description">
 <p><img src="https://trello.com/1/cards/680b3113bcf04fb389ca2dea/attachments/680b32abd7294beabd6cdbaf/download/%D0%91%D0%B5%D0%B7%2B%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%B7%D0%B2%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%8F79_20250425115823.png" alt="image.png"></p>
<p>Red line = Repeatable</p>
<p>[&quot;SuperClass&quot;] - 1 soul point for obtaining each unique super class (same super class don&#39;t give soul points twice)</p>
<p>[&quot;BossKill&quot;] - 3 soul points for each unique boss you defeat. (same boss don&#39;t give soul points twice)</p>
<hr>
<p>Note: Currently there&#39;s a bug in game that makes covenant sp repeatable.</p>
 </div>
