 <li itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/ListItem">
 <a itemprop="url" href="/c/QgaEV3dm/182-soul-tree"
 rel="nofollow" >
 <span itemprop="name">
 Soul Tree
 </span>
 </a>
 <div itemprop="description">
 <p>The skill tree includes three paths, the path of destruction, the path of empowerment, and the path of sundry.</p>
<p>‌</p>
<p>It currently takes <strong>118</strong> Soul Points to max all of the skill trees.<br>Soul tree is meant for a way progress save through wipes, as it cannot be lost or reset in any means.</p>
<hr>
<h2>Path of Destruction</h2>
<p><img src="https://trello.com/1/cards/67b33754cae287c69e92b1de/attachments/67b4105c51cc7e8adb8d147c/download/recolor.png" alt="recolor.png"></p>
<p><strong>Left Branch</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Crit Chance 1 (1 SP) +2% Crit Chance</li>
<li>Crit Chance 2 (2 SP) +2% Crit Chance</li>
<li>Crit Chance 3 (2 SP) +3% Crit Chance</li>
<li>Crit Chance 4 (2 SP) +3% Crit Chance (+10% Crit Chs Overall)</li>
<li>Crit Damage 1 (2 SP) +0.10x Crit Damage</li>
<li>Crit Damage 2 (2 SP) +0.10x Crit Damage (+.20x Crit Dmg Overall)</li>
<li>DOT 1 (2 SP) X DOT damage</li>
<li>DOT 2 (2 SP) X DOT damage</li>
<li>DOT 3 (2 SP) X DOT damage</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Middle Branch</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Damage 1 (1 SP) +5% Damage</li>
<li>Strength 1 (1 SP) +2 Strength Stat Points</li>
<li>Strength 2 (1 SP) +2 Strength Stat Points</li>
<li>Strength 3 (2 SP) +4 Strength Stat Points</li>
<li>Strength 4 (2 SP) +4 Strength Stat Points (+12 Str Overall)</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Right Branch</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Arcane 1 (1 SP) +2 Arcane Stat Points</li>
<li>Arcane 2 (1 SP) +2 Arcane Stat Points</li>
<li>Arcane 3 (2 SP) +4 Arcane Stat Points</li>
<li>Arcane 4 (2 SP) +4 Arcane Stat Points (+12 Arc Overall)</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Top Branch Left Side</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Damage 2 (3 SP) +5% Damage</li>
<li>Poison Damage (2 SP) Increases poison damage by 5%.</li>
<li>Dark Damage (2 SP) Increases dark damage by 5%.</li>
<li>Physical Damage (2 SP) Increases physical damage by 5%.</li>
<li>Magical Damage (2 SP) Increases magical damage by 5%.</li>
<li>Fire Damage (2 SP) Increases fire damage by 5%.</li>
<li>Holy Damage (2 SP) Increases holy damage by 5%.</li>
<li>Nature Damage (2 SP) Increases nature damage by 5%.</li>
<li>Hex Damage (2 SP) Increases hex damage by 5%.</li>
<li>Ice Damage (2 SP) increases Ice damage by 5%.</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Top Branch Right Side</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Recovering Blows (5 SP) Gives 1+ energy when you kill a enemy</li>
<li>Rebound (4 SP) Missing a attack shortens the cooldown of said attack</li>
<li>Piercing (6 SP) Attacks have a chance to go through enemies innate resistances</li>
</ul>
<p>Notes:</p>
<ul>
<li>Do Note that the dmg buffs here are MULTIPLICATIVE, not ADDITIVE. So that its not 5x15% but rather 5x5%x5%x5%.</li>
<li>Crit Damage &amp; Crit Chance are added to their stats, not that their stats are multiplied by it.</li>
</ul>
<p>The Path of Destruction costs in total <strong>59 Soul Points</strong>.</p>
<hr>
<h2>Path of Empowerment</h2>
<p><img src="https://trello.com/1/cards/67b33754cae287c69e92b1de/attachments/68959d70df1ddd8d84ffc82c/download/image.png" alt="image.png"></p>
<p><strong>Left Branch</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Health 1 (1 SP) +3 Max HP</li>
<li>Health 2 (1 SP) +3 Max HP</li>
<li>Health 3 (2 SP) +5 Max HP</li>
<li>Health 4 (2 SP) +5 Max HP</li>
<li>Health 5 (2 SP) +7 Max HP</li>
<li>Health 6 (3 SP) +7 Max HP</li>
<li>Health 7 (3 SP) +8 Max HP (+38 Max HP Overall)</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>First Right Offshoot</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Status Resist 1 (2 SP) Reduce status effect damage by ??%</li>
<li>Status Resist 2 (2 SP) Reduce status effect damage by ??%</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Second Right Offshoot</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Encounter Regen 1 (1 SP) 5% Max HP on Battle End</li>
<li>Encounter Regen 2 (2 SP) 5% Max HP on Battle End</li>
<li>Encounter Regen 3 (2 SP) 5% Max HP on Battle End</li>
<li>Encounter Regen 4 (2 SP) 5% Max HP on Battle End (20% Max HP on Battle End Overall)</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Third Right Offshoot</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Regen 1 (2 SP) +0.5 HP per turn</li>
<li>Regen 2 (2 SP) +0.5 HP per turn</li>
<li>Regen 3 (3 SP) +1 HP per turn (+2 HP per turn Overall)</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Fourth Right Offshoot</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Defense 1 (2 SP) 2.5% Damage Reduction</li>
<li>Defense 2 (2 SP) 5% Damage Reduction</li>
</ul>
<p>Notes:</p>
<ul>
<li>Regen from the In-Combat Regen &amp; also regen from other sources such as naturally from super classes are known to <em>randomly double</em>.</li>
</ul>
<p>The Path of Empowerment takes <strong>36 Soul Points</strong> to max out. (However, Encounter Regen is commonly ignored by players, as it does not help during fight). Ignoring Encounter Regen it only takes <em><strong>29 Soul Points</strong></em>. (cause Encounter Regen sucks)</p>
<hr>
<h2>Path of Sundry</h2>
<p><img src="https://trello.com/1/cards/67b33754cae287c69e92b1de/attachments/68959d7b0e2160582184fabe/download/image.png" alt="image.png"></p>
<p><strong>Left Branch</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Essence Gain 1 (1 SP) Increases essence gain by 10%.</li>
<li>Essence Gain 2 (1 SP) Increases essence gain by 5%.</li>
<li>Essence Gain 3 (1 SP) Increases essence gain by 10%.</li>
<li>Essence Gain 4 (2 SP) Increases essence gain by 10%.</li>
<li>Essence Gain 5 (2 SP) Increases essence gain by ??%</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Left Branch’s Right Offshoot</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Sell Price 1 (1 SP) +5% Sell Price</li>
<li>Sell Price 2 (2 SP) +10% Sell Price</li>
<li>Sell Price 3 (2 SP) +10% Sell Price (+25% Sell Price Overall)</li>
<li>Soul Vault (6 SP) New bank slot that keeps any item you put in after you wipe.</li>
<li>Cursed Hunter (4 SP) Doubles progression gained from killing corrupted enemies for a quest</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Right Branch</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Speed 1 (1 SP) +2 Speed Stat Points</li>
<li>Speed 2 (1 SP) +3 Speed Stat Points</li>
<li>Speed 3 (1 SP) +3 Speed Stat Points</li>
<li>Speed 4 (2 SP) +4 Speed Stat Points (+12 SPD Overall)</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Right Branch’s Left Offshoot</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Luck 1 (1 SP) +2 Luck Stat Points</li>
<li>Luck 2 (1 SP) +2 Luck Stat Points</li>
<li>Luck 3 (1 SP) +3 Luck Stat Points (+7 LCK Overall)</li>
<li>Harvester (4 SP) Chance to double harvested plant drops</li>
</ul>
<p>The Path of Sundry takes <strong>33 Soul Points</strong> to max out.</p>
